codex
I found the concrete sandbox incompatibility: Lean 4.22 resolves its own executable through `/proc/<numeric-pid>/exe`, while this audit sandbox permits `/proc/self/exe` but denies the numeric form. I’ll use a narrow read-only compatibility shim that rewrites only that lookup to `/proc/self/exe`, record its source and hash, and rerun the unmodified trusted checker.
